idle-detect (0.9.2.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.9.2.2.
  * idle_detect: count only screen-idle inhibitions when deciding whether the
    desktop is inhibited. A sleep-only lock (a download in progress) no longer
    pins distributed computing paused; media playback still does.
  * Flush every log line so the daemons' own lines reach the journal at the
    time they are written instead of in a batch at the next error or exit.
  * See https://github.com/jamescowens/idle_detect/releases for details.

 -- James C. Owens <jamesowens@optonline.net>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:35:57 -0400

idle-detect (0.9.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.9.2.1.
  * dc_fah_v8: select the Folding@home v8 API by client version; verify
    against the per-group paused flag that 8.3 and later use.
  * event_detect: throttle the "No pointing devices" report instead of
    logging it once a second on machines without a mouse.
  * See https://github.com/jamescowens/idle_detect/releases for details.

 -- James C. Owens <jamesowens@optonline.net>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 13:45:56 -0400

